      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Data experts have pointed out that the solution is excessively outdated,
          as storing paper records requires a large workforce capable of conducting
          thorough and meticulous data cataloguing and archiving.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
