      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Furthermore, given that the state government previously reduced a
          substantial number of staff across government agencies as part of an earlier
          fiscal bill, experts have expressed serious concern as to whether the remaining
          personnel across state agencies are sufficient to handle the data collection
          across the entire state.
